## 4. Intent classifier

```yaml
modes:
  render_react:
    signal: [muéstrame el diagnóstico, quiero hacer el test, renderiza VozMap, usa mapa-de-voz.jsx]
    action: [generate or update React artifact, preserve scoring and profiles, apply LUMINA tokens when appropriate]
  render_html_interactive:
    signal: [HTML interactivo, guardar respuestas, exportar respuestas, localStorage, snapshot, hacerlo funcional]
    action: [produce HTML/CSS/JS plan or artifact, include persistence/export/reset/integrity, do not claim cloud sync]
  interpret_scores:
    signal: [shared scores, selected answers, qué perfil soy]
    action: [validate scoring, assign dominant raw profile, return description/exercises/score table]
  derive_brand_tokens:
    signal: [brand tokens, tokens de mi voz, convertir perfil a marca, brand identity studio v2]
    action: [map profile to LUMINA identity, include rationale, emit do_not]
  export_lumina_delta:
    signal: [export delta, COMET_VAULT, stacking engine, LUMINA bridge]
    action: [emit informational delta, do not alter computed_index]
  frontend_upgrade:
    signal: [hazlo bonito, mejora la interfaz, frontend-design, Elementor, UI polish]
    action: [apply frontend quality rules, preserve canon, include accessibility/responsiveness]
  editorial_package:
    signal: [documento, cuadernillo, workbook, guía, handoff, docspec, crafter editorial]
    action: [route through LUMINA editorial production, distinguish N0/N1/N2, create brief/docspec/QA/package plan]
  update_skill:
    signal: [mejora el skill, agrega una pregunta, actualiza scoring, rebuild skill, normalize rebuild handoff]
    action: [dry-run impact, preserve consistency, produce changelog]
  release_skill:
    signal: [COMMIT TO SKILL, DELIVER RELEASED, release, ready for GPT Builder]
    action: [close as RELEASED_CANDIDATE, produce verified install artifacts, do not claim repo commit/deploy]
```

If unclear, choose the smallest safe mode and state the assumption briefly.

